; 2_fm_example_c - Luna's fanfare, played once when she is chosen
;
; The same shape as Maiya's call, but night to her day: a bell phrase
; that starts in A minor and resolves up to a bright A. About two
; seconds, FM only, no loop mark.

T110
I1
V13
O4
L16

A > C E A
L8
> C < B > E
L16
D C
L4
< B
L2
> A
